  "title": "Lumexa Imaging Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call Date",
  "summary": "Lumexa Imaging (NASDAQ: LMRI), one of the nation’s largest providers of outpatient imaging services, today announced it will release its first quarter 2026 financial and operational results after market close on Tuesday, May 12, 2026. The Company will host a conference call and live webcast to discuss the results at 5:00 p.m. ET.",
